defconfig fragment: the IPVS match for Docker (CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_IPVS, which depends on CONFIG_IP_VS).
WARNING, measured 2026-10-31: built in, IP_VS adds a field to struct net, which changes 2689 of the 13665
exported-symbol CRCs of the maintainer's kernel (modversions). Vendor modules built against the maintainer's CRCs
can then be refused. Skip this patch with THIN_SKIP=ipvs (thin/README.md, "kABI").
Applies in the kernel tree (git apply), pinned at e615f34c7dcb. Independent of 0001: anchored at the end of the file.

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vanillaKernel-defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vanillaKernel-defconfig
@@ -148,3 +148,7 @@

 # Module security
 CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y
+
+# Docker: IPVS match, needs IP_VS itself (thin kernel patch set)
+CONFIG_IP_VS=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_IPVS=y
